# Cloudflare Pages _redirects: serve the single-file site for every real path.
# The client router reads location.pathname, so /books, /about, /blog and
# /blog/<slug> all load index.html and show the right page. /admin is the
# private login page (not linked anywhere public). Old #/ links are handled
# client-side by the router, which replaces them with the real path.
#
# WHY THIS FILE IS SHORT NOW
# The 2026-11-19 version listed both slash forms of every path plus a
# /* catch-all, 27 rules. The Cloudflare build log for the Nov 22
# production deployment (commit c211236) parsed only 13 of them as valid
# and flagged the other 14 as invalid and ignored, for infinite-loop
# detection: every trailing-slash variant such as /books/ to /index.html
# and the /* to /index.html catch-all. The trailing-slash form kept
# working anyway, through Pages built-in SPA fallback, while the
# no-slash form still loaded Home, so _redirects alone was not fixing
# the live route. The real fix is functions/_middleware.js, a Pages
# Function that serves index.html for every known single-page-app path
# with the request URL unchanged. This file is kept as a fallback with
# only the rules Pages accepts: the no-slash form of every public path,
# plus /blog/* for blog slugs and /sitemap.xml.
#
# DEPLOY NOTE: this file must sit at the REPO ROOT, next to index.html,
# sitemap.xml and functions/. It is NOT inside laketha-hicks-site.zip
# (the zip contains only index.html), so a zip-only deploy does NOT carry
# it. functions/_middleware.js must also be added to the repo root
# under functions/, next to api/.
#
# ORDER: first match wins. Requests handled by Pages Functions (/api/*)
# skip _redirects entirely, so the subscribe, login and posts endpoints
# are not affected by any rule here. /assets/* is not listed: static
# assets are served directly by Pages.
/ /index.html 200
/books /index.html 200
/about /index.html 200
/speaking /index.html 200
/faq /index.html 200
/blog /index.html 200
/blog/* /index.html 200
/contact /index.html 200
/admin /index.html 200
/devotional /index.html 200
/portraits /index.html 200
/covers /index.html 200
/journey /index.html 200
/credentials /index.html 200
/sitemap.xml /sitemap.xml 200
